  - actor-specific access
  - subjective evaluation
  - expectation state
  - expected interval change
  - micro-macro linkage
  - reputation economy
  - credit economy
  - actor-side process
  - resource dynamics
  - measurement proxy
  - economic projection
  - social dynamics
